    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "## Problem\n\nTracked by #39683\n\nRelated #15462\n\nA _port_ (not just a rewrite) of matchit.vim to lua is necessary in neovim. While offering functionality sensible to core, the original code:\n\n- has weird, extensive features (debug mode)\n- is unmaintainable (long, unintuitive)\n\n\"rewriting\" the plugin would be a waste of an opportunity of Neovim's faculties in 0.13+.\n\n## Solution\n\nMay it be discussed here!\n\n@ofseed",
